OL,3,AbA Scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,4,A'unprecedented' but no sign of
OL,5,Abreaches, says expert
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the UK, a minister said just after
OL,8,Fmidday that 32 government services were
OL,9,Funavailable and four partially
OL,10,Funavailable because they were being
OL,11,Ffixed - the Canadian government says
OL,12,Fsome of its services are also down
OL,14,FThe chief executive of Microsoft, Satya
OL,15,FNadella, says he has "not seen anything
OL,16,Flike this in a long, long time"
OL,18,FIn Chepstow in the UK, one garage owner
OL,19,Fsays he's been unable to process MOTs
OL,20,Fonline - he's been using pen and paper
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
