OL,3,ACrowd of 50 beats foreigner to death in
OL,4,ASouth Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foreign national has been beaten to
OL,7,Fdeath by a crowd of about 50 people in
OL,8,FDurban, South Africa, police say.
OL,10,FAccording to police, the unidentified
OL,11,Fman, believed to be in his late 30s or
OL,12,Fearly 40s, was first approached by two
OL,13,Fmen by the roadside before being
OL,14,Fassaulted by a larger group. He was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FPolice have launched an investigation
OL,18,Finto the murder, with the motive yet to
OL,19,Fbe established.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
